	 (2,'Hilton Garden Inn','https://maps.app.goo.gl/5kWk3usHB4PGcM1dA','https://hiltongardeninn3.hilton.com/en/index.html','Hilton Garden Inn is a brand of Hilton Worldwide that focuses on mid-priced, upscale hotels for both business and leisure travelers.','2024-01-06 18:10:14.148','2024-01-06 18:10:14.148'),
	 (3,'Marriott Marquis','https://maps.app.goo.gl/8Eq86DgY2iWG8FdG8','https://www.marriott.com/','Marriott Marquis is a luxury hotel brand under the Marriott International umbrella, known for its high-end accommodations and exceptional service.','2024-01-06 18:10:14.148','2024-01-06 18:10:14.148'),
	 (4,'Holiday Inn Express','https://maps.app.goo.gl/6zLpN4v3ZxXy2MBt8','https://www.ihg.com/holidayinnexpress','Holiday Inn Express is a mid-priced hotel chain that offers comfort, convenience, and value for both business and leisure travelers.','2024-01-06 18:10:14.148','2024-01-06 18:10:14.148'),
	 (5,'Sheraton Hotels & Resorts','https://maps.app.goo.gl/VkWLShh1P7pbFhzP9','https://www.marriott.com/sheraton/index.mi','Sheraton Hotels & Resorts, now part of Marriott International, is a global hospitality brand known for its upscale accommodations and exceptional guest experiences.','2024-01-06 18:10:14.148','2024-01-06 18:10:14.148'),
	 (6,'Westin Hotels & Resorts','https://maps.app.goo.gl/1K3NNJwBNVwW5sPa6','https://www.marriott.com/westin/index.mi','Westin Hotels & Resorts, part of Marriott International, offers upscale accommodations focusing on wellness for travelers seeking revitalizing experiences.','2024-01-06 18:10:14.148','2024-01-06 18:10:14.148'),
	 (2,'Hyatt Regency','https://maps.app.goo.gl/sQ7n8SE6KZKjwHfP6','https://www.hyatt.com/','Hyatt Regency is a brand of Hyatt Hotels Corporation known for its modern accommodations, upscale amenities, and global presence.','2024-01-06 18:10:14.148','2024-01-06 18:10:14.148'),
	 (3,'InterContinental Hotels & Resorts','https://maps.app.goo.gl/NNCpDhSPiNVGh7WJ7','https://www.ihg.com/intercontinental/','InterContinental Hotels & Resorts is a luxury hotel brand that offers premium accommodations and personalized services across various locations worldwide.','2024-01-06 18:10:14.148','2024-01-06 18:10:14.148'),
	 (4,'Best Western Plus','https://maps.app.goo.gl/owVeZLtyxjYUCJWr8','https://www.bestwestern.com/','Best Western Plus is a mid-scale hotel brand that provides upgraded amenities and services for travelers seeking comfortable stays.','2024-01-06 18:10:14.148','2024-01-06 18:10:14.148'),
	 (5,'Fairfield by Marriott','https://maps.app.goo.gl/TEYbTCkdnbqfEqTi8','https://www.marriott.com/fairfield-inn-and-suites/travel.mi','Fairfield by Marriott offers comfortable and reliable accommodations designed for value-conscious travelers seeking quality experiences.','2024-01-06 18:10:14.148','2024-01-06 18:10:14.148');
